  "expertText": "* = $0801\n; User MACRO/ENDM demo – define reusable code blocks and invoke them\n.macro set_border color\n    LDA #{color}\n    STA $D020\n.endm\n.macro increment_bg\n    LDA $D021\n    CLC\n    ADC #$01\n    AND #$0F\n    STA $D021\n.endm\n    SEI\n.invoke set_border(0)\nloop:\n.invoke increment_bg()\n.loop X, $00, dly\n.next dly\n    JMP loop",
